Subject: [PATCH 6.12.y] wifi: brcmfmac: drain bus_reset work on device removal
Date: Thu,  6 Aug 2026 09:22:30 -0400
Message-ID: <20260806132230.416656-1-sashal@kernel.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.53.0
In-Reply-To: <2026072952-pacifism-magnify-5cce@gregkh>
